; SLIP STOP + START: must answer the first ping after the restart (needs
; tools/bench/slippeer.py, the "PrismNet slip" config and s2stat from make diag).
; Before the fix, slip.device kept the old core's reads and ~34 packets vanished.
Delete ENV:PrismNet/interfaces/#? ENV:PrismNet/~(interfaces) QUIET
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/slip ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
MakeDir ENV:SANA2 >NIL:
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/slip0.config ENV:SANA2/slip0.config
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/rs.log
C:PrismNet START >NIL:
Execute DH0:PrismNet/t-pingloop 3 first
C:PrismNet STOP >NIL:
Wait 2
C:PrismNet START >NIL:
Execute DH0:PrismNet/t-pingloop 42 restart
C:PrismNet STOP >NIL:
Echo "=== done" >>DH0:PrismNet/rs.log
